{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIwL0dpcmxzJTIwQ2FudCUyMFN1cmYlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Girls Cant Surf","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fQQzlMZPmvxbMYTN8vWvq5wf8LU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pUhkv5bxK6mu7691gfNl0H7r03p.jpg","description":"It’s the 1980s and the world of professional surfing is a circus of fluorescent colors, peroxide hair and radical male egos. \"Girls Can't Surf\" follows the journey of a band of renegade surfers who took on the male-dominated professional surfing world to achieve equality and change the sport forever. Featuring surfing greats Jodie Cooper, Frieda Zamba, Pauline Menczer, Lisa Andersen, Pam Burridge, Wendy Botha, Layne Beachley and more, \"Girls Can't Surf\" is a wild ride of clashing personalities, sexism, adventure and heartbreak, with each woman fighting against the odds to make their dreams of competing a reality.\n\nRated NR · Released 11 Mar 2021 · Australia · Language: English · 108 min\nStudio: FINCH, Pursekey Productions, Whipped Sea\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Documentary","History","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.8","imdb_id":"tt9005244","moviedb_id":746267,"tmdbId":746267,"runtime":"108 min","cast":["Pam Burridge","Lisa Anderson","Wendy Botha","Jodie Cooper","Rochelle Ballard","Pauline Menczer","Jolene Smith","Jorja Smith Harmon"],"director":["Christopher Nelius"],"writer":["Christopher Nelius","Julie-Anne De Ruvo"],"released":"2021-03-11T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Australia","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Christopher Nelius","character":"Director"},{"name":"Pam Burridge"},{"name":"Lisa Anderson"},{"name":"Wendy Botha"},{"name":"Jodie Cooper"},{"name":"Rochelle Ballard"},{"name":"Pauline Menczer"},{"name":"Jolene Smith"},{"name":"Jorja Smith Harmon"},{"name":"Nick Carroll","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2jf0ELcZIP53HR6Ewsy7m0ioKC1.jpg"},{"name":"Jamie R. Brisick"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"CNtqBLh84zQ","type":"Trailer"},{"source":"rBjcbZla2cA","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer: Official Trailer","ytId":"CNtqBLh84zQ"},{"title":"Trailer: Girls Can't Surf - Official Trailer","ytId":"rBjcbZla2cA"}],"links":[{"name":"Pam Burridge","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Pam%20Burridge"},{"name":"Lisa Anderson","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Lisa%20Anderson"},{"name":"Wendy Botha","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Wendy%20Botha"},{"name":"Jodie Cooper","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jodie%20Cooper"},{"name":"Rochelle Ballard","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Rochelle%20Ballard"},{"name":"Pauline Menczer","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Pauline%20Menczer"},{"name":"Jolene Smith","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jolene%20Smith"},{"name":"Jorja Smith Harmon","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jorja%20Smith%20Harmon"},{"name":"Christopher Nelius","category":"Director","url":"stremio:///search?search=Christopher%20Nelius"},{"name":"Christopher Nelius","category":"Writer","url":"stremio:///search?search=Christopher%20Nelius"},{"name":"Julie-Anne De Ruvo","category":"Writer","url":"stremio:///search?search=Julie-Anne%20De%20Ruvo"},{"name":"Documentary","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///search?search=Documentary"},{"name":"History","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///search?search=History"},{"name":"FINCH","category":"Studio","url":"stremio:///search?search=FINCH"},{"name":"Pursekey Productions","category":"Studio","url":"stremio:///search?search=Pursekey%20Productions"},{"name":"Whipped Sea","category":"Studio","url":"stremio:///search?search=Whipped%20Sea"},{"name":"I Am Ali","category":"More like this","url":"stremio:///detail/movie/dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0klMjBBbSUyMEFsaSUyMCUyODIwMTQlMjkv"},{"name":"Miss American